"btnAcceptConsent\">Accept All</button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Master Logic Script -->\r\n  \r\n\r\n  <!-- FAQ Accordion Script -->\r\n  \r\n"
